English adaptation of ja-writing-guard:
  https://github.com/TakeshiTGAL/hermes-plugin-ja-writing-guard
  Copyright (c) 2026 TakeshiTGAL
  MIT License (LICENSE).

The retained hook, deadline, attachment, tool and report infrastructure derives
from that project. Its complete original attribution notice is preserved in
NOTICE.upstream as a historical notice. Descriptions there of Japanese rules
and evaluation data refer to version 0.1.0; those assets are no longer shipped.

English editing guidance and catalog ideas adapted from work-humanizer:
  https://github.com/phuryn/work-humanizer
  Revision: 0a9065791d021f3dda695f3887cb2ae4c0eacbcf
  Files consulted: skills/work-humanizer/SKILL.md, tells.md, check.py
  Copyright (c) 2026 Pawel Huryn
  MIT License.

The English rules, prompts and portable skill adapt its guidance on facts,
commitments, certainty, source reasoning, interview questions and formulaic
wording. The corpus helper is a new implementation. This project does not
inherit work-humanizer's evaluation results or make detector-evasion claims.

